  {
   "id": "hell-is-other-demons-56062@patch-2020-08-26",
   "gameId": "hell-is-other-demons-56062",
   "displayName": "The Aiming Patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-08-26T13:47:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Believe it or not, but we are back with another patch for Hell is Other Demons!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Aiming",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Ever since I started showing HiOD to the public, the main suggestion I got was the ability to aim. You asked for it, and eventually you got it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now toggle 360 degree aiming in the Gameplay Settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For all you WASD + Mouse fans out there, there is also experimental in game mouse aiming that can be enabled under Settings > Controls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The Archer",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tailor made for this, another playable arcade mode character, The Archer, joins the ranks with his Time- and Space bending kit:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Press and Hold the Attack button to aim and slow time. Release to fire a piercing arrow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your ultimate is a slow moving Black Hole that sucks in everything in it's way.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Japanese and Korean localization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our friends at Kakehashi Games has helped out to localize and release the game in Japan and South Korea.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "/Hannes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
