  {
   "id": "hell-is-other-demons-56062@post-2019-05-25",
   "gameId": "hell-is-other-demons-56062",
   "displayName": "Hell is Other Updates 2019-05-25",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-05-25T07:30:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hell is Other Demons has been out on Steam for a couple of days now and the critical response has been amazing! We are currently hard at work squashing bugs, improving the game and working on the next free content patch. On top of all the ideas I already have, the community has been coming up with awesome upgrades, characters, weapons and features.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Let us know what YOU would like to see in the discussion forum or on our Discord: https://discordapp.com/invite/YVtxqXH",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Another way to help is by writing a review, right here on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Here are a few of the things that were fixed this week.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Balance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked Upgrades Explosion- and Laser-Proof. They now have 3 charges per level instead of infinite.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unbanned Health Upgrades from The Cloak: Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added default gamepad controller mappings on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Now supports Switch Pro Controller on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Now pauses the game if the current input device gets disconnected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now pauses the game if the Steam Overlay is activated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Made Spike Traps more visible in Boneyard.: Bugfixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the game would not progress to the results screen if you died between killing a boss and picking up the artefact.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the optional objectives wouldn't trigger for the last boss.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed typo in Tip mentioning the Ultimate button.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed typo in French Tutorial text.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Steam Achievements that unlocked in error.: See you on the leaderboards, demons!: /Hannes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
